<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">At December 31, 2023, there was approximately $300,000
of unrecognized compensation costs related to stock options which will be recognized over the weighted average remaining years of 0.84.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

